  "result": "Perfect! All tests pass, including the full test suite with 617 tests across 73 files. The fix is complete and working correctly.\n\n**Summary of the fix:**\n\nThe security issue was in the `acceptInvitation` function in `src/server/services/invitation-service.ts`. When a user tried to accept an invitation using the token, the function was checking if the invitation had already been accepted or if it had expired, but it was **not checking if the invitation had been revoked** (cancelled).\n\nI added a check for `invitation.revokedAt !== null` at the beginning of the validation logic, which now prevents cancelled invitations from being used to create memberships. The existing test for revoked invitations confirms this fix is working as expected.",
